{"id":"eeae9a7ce9dd34c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-skipping.md","title":"Skipping","display":"df-skipping — Skipping","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-skipping","aliases":["58-df-skipping","Skipping (Model Theory)"],"display":"df-skipping — Skipping","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-skipping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-skipping</span><span>Skipping (Model Theory)</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skipping — Skipping"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,p,n\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,p,n\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal M\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\)</span> (完备类型与实现谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure-universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (公式集与自由变元算子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkipsType}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{SkipsType}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Skips}_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\mathrm{Skips}_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> (compatibility notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skipping}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkipsType}_S(\\mathcal N,p,\\mathcal M,n,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathcal M\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists T\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;T=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\n\\bigl(p,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M),T,\\mathcal L,n\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\vec b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)^n\\;\n\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal N,\\vec b,p)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skipping}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkipsType}_S(\\mathcal N,p,\\mathcal M,n,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathcal M\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\\land n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists T\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;T=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\n\\bigl(p,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M),T,\\mathcal L,n\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\vec b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)^n\\;\n\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal N,\\vec b,p)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skipping\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Skips}_{\\mathcal M}(\\mathcal N,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n,\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{SkipsType}_S(\\mathcal N,p,\\mathcal M,n,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skipping\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Skips}_{\\mathcal M}(\\mathcal N,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n,\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{SkipsType}_S(\\mathcal N,p,\\mathcal M,n,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件采用标准且可核验的“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 跳过（省略）类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>”含义：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 中没有实现。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 被校验为相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 的完备 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-类型，且“不实现”直接调用书内 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\)</span>，不再依赖无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(\\mathcal M)\">\\(S_n(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Existentially closed: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\models \\exists x\\, \\phi(x, a)\">\\(M \\models \\exists x\\, \\phi(x, a)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\in M\">\\(a \\in M\\)</span> implies realization in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></li>\n<li>purity、cofinality 与饱和性是不同概念，已从 assertion 移出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hodges, Model Theory</li>\n<li>Kim, Forking in Simple Theories</li>\n<li>Pillay, An Introduction to Stability Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"